<item>
  <title>Giving GPT-3 a Turing Test</title>
  <dc:creator>synesis </dc:creator>
  <link>https://benjaminhan.net/posts/20200718-gpt3-turing-test/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=feed</link>
  <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://benjaminhan.net/posts/20200718-gpt3-turing-test/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=feed">Read on benjaminhan.net →</a></p>
 





<div class="quarto-figure quarto-figure-center">
<figure class="figure">
<p><img src="https://benjaminhan.net/posts/20200718-gpt3-turing-test/cover.jpg" class="img-fluid figure-img"></p>
<figcaption>Giving GPT-3 a Turing test. Image from <a href="https://lacker.io/ai/2020/07/06/giving-gpt-3-a-turing-test.html">Kevin Lacker</a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
